  "Visualize long-term data such as annual variations in processes and parameters that can vary depending on days of the week or shifts, etc.": "可視化可以在很長一段時間內隨數據而變化的參數，例如過程，一周中的天數，輪班等等。",
  "Visualize the correlation between a large number of variables with respect to target variable.": "可視化大量變量相對於目標變量之間的相關性。",
  "Visualize co-occurrence (relationships that focus on how often one phenomenon and another occur at the same time) of faults/alarms.": "可視化故障，警報，事件等的同時出現（重點是同時出現一種現象的頻率）。",
  "Digital Native QC 7 Tools: 7 QC tools compatible with DX developed as tools to support QC activities suitable for the digital native era.": "空的Digital Native QC 7 Tools : デジタルネイティブ時代にふさわしいQC活動を支えるツールとして開発された、DXに対応したQC7つ道具。",
  "Analysis Platform : That makes it easy to data link, visualize, statistical analysis, and machine learning.": "Analysis Platform：用於數據映射，可視化，統計分析和機器學習的簡單工具。",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value) to be plotted on the graph. Select the process and item you want to plot on the graph.": "指定圖的數據（例如數值變量：測量值）。選擇要在圖上繪製的過程和項目。最多可以選擇20個項目。",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value) to create data distributions. This data is plotted on the graph.": "指定圖的數據（例如數值變量：測量值）。選擇要在圖上繪製的過程和項目。最多可以選擇8個項目。",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value and category variable like part number) to visualize pattern. This data is plotted on the graph. It can be selected up to ten items.": "空的可視化したいパターンを生成するデータ(量的変数：測定値など、カテゴリ変数 : 品番など)の項目です。このデータがグラフにプロットされます。最大18項目選択できます。",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value) to visualize the correlation between variables. This data is plotted on the graph. It can be selected up to four items.": "可視化變量之間相關性的數據項（定量變量：測量值等）。該數據繪製在圖表上。可以選擇2到7個參數。",
  "Enter target item of quantitative variable (like measurement value) in data to visualize the correlation between variables. This data is plotted on the graph.": "選擇項目以可視化變量之間的相關性。最多可以選擇60個項目。",
  "Enter target item of category variable (like part number) in data to visualize the correlation between variables. This data is plotted on the graph.": "類別變量（例如零件號）的項目可視化變量之間的相關性。",
